# k.objects/shards/things-2: wagon, artillery shell, rifle, statue, radar, nest, tire, lance, pillow, bin, cabinet, collar, cannon, rod, sweater, plug, shotgun, bracelet, armor, portrait, dice, wig, peg, stove. Parts with a primitive shape, a box in the 0 to 100 frame
